# Literature-based ideal model, assembled 2026-11-08; not a database deposit.
# Source: Nunes et al., ISIJ International 55 (2015) 2450-2454, Table 1.
# https://doi.org/10.2355/isijinternational.ISIJINT-2015-111
# Reported a=0.3624 nm and c=0.7406 nm converted to angstrom below.
# Tetragonal gamma double prime; NOT the orthorhombic Ni3Nb delta phase.
# Full chemical order, full occupancies, zero displacement parameters.
# Actual alloy composition, temperature and coherency strain may change the cell.
